Z||000000||Buster||08-11-2000||05:27 PM||||Hello: V6 in an 88. There is a 3/4 inch diameter black metal tube around the front valve cover that goes into the rubber intake tube just in front of the throttle body. This tube has a flat support strap that goes to a bolt on the end of the head. Can you tell me the bolt dimensions. TIA<P>Buster||||reg||1
Z||000001||PJ||08-13-2000||09:15 PM||||Buster, its a metric 10mm x 1.50 threaded bolt, about an inch long. The head is a 15mm hex.<P>PJ<BR>||||reg||1
